Quality gate

Uniqueness: embedding similarity < 0.90 vs. existing pages.

Length: ≥ 900–1500 words; headings every ~150–250 words.

Links: ≥ 2 internal hubs, ≥ 1 external authoritative source (non-competitor).

Schema valid; noindex cleared only after pass.

Doorway safety

Geo pages include local specifics (codes, climate, vendors, case details)—not just city tokens. If not, block generation for that variant. 
